WEBVTT

00:00:03.418 --> 00:00:04.498
(SIGHS)

00:00:05.658 --> 00:00:09.258
Can there be a day
beyond this night?

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:13.978
I don't know anymore
what is true

00:00:15.178 --> 00:00:19.418
I can't find my direction
I'm all alone

00:00:19.818 --> 00:00:25.538
The only star that guided me
was you

00:00:26.298 --> 00:00:30.418
How to rise from the floor

00:00:30.578 --> 00:00:35.058
When it's not you
I'm rising for?

00:00:35.538 --> 00:00:39.018
Just do the next right thing

00:00:40.138 --> 00:00:41.858
Take a step

00:00:42.298 --> 00:00:43.858
Step again

00:00:44.618 --> 00:00:49.418
It is all that I can

00:00:49.578 --> 00:00:54.858
To do the next right thing

00:00:56.978 --> 00:00:59.738
I won't look too far ahead

00:00:59.818 --> 00:01:01.018
(SHUDDERING)

00:01:01.138 --> 00:01:04.378
It's too much for me to take

00:01:05.138 --> 00:01:08.058
But break it down
to this next breath

00:01:08.658 --> 00:01:10.618
This next step

00:01:10.778 --> 00:01:14.938
This next choice
is one that I can make!

00:01:16.338 --> 00:01:17.418
(GRUNTS)

00:01:17.498 --> 00:01:21.578
So I'll walk through
this night

00:01:21.778 --> 00:01:26.258
Stumbling blindly
toward the light

00:01:26.778 --> 00:01:30.978
And do the next right thing

00:01:32.098 --> 00:01:34.458
And with the dawn

00:01:34.618 --> 00:01:36.578
What comes then?

00:01:36.738 --> 00:01:39.418
When it's clear
that everything

00:01:39.498 --> 00:01:43.498
Will never be the same again?

00:01:44.658 --> 00:01:46.098
(SIGHS DEEPLY)

00:01:46.178 --> 00:01:48.298
Then I'll make the choice

00:01:49.378 --> 00:01:51.938
To hear that voice

00:01:52.858 --> 00:01:55.418
And do

00:01:55.858 --> 00:02:00.018
The next right thing

00:02:02.818 --> 00:02:03.938
(SIGHS)

00:02:10.938 --> 00:02:12.218
(PANTING)

00:02:15.618 --> 00:02:16.738
(INHALES SHARPLY)

00:02:16.818 --> 00:02:18.338
Wake up!

00:02:18.778 --> 00:02:20.418
(EARTH GIANTS SNORING)

00:02:21.738 --> 00:02:23.978
Wake up!

00:02:33.818 --> 00:02:34.858
(GRUNTS)

00:02:37.538 --> 00:02:38.578
(GROANING)

00:02:42.458 --> 00:02:43.658
(EARTH GIANT GROWLING)

00:02:44.018 --> 00:02:45.578
That's it.

00:02:45.738 --> 00:02:47.738
Come and get me!
Come on!

00:02:53.618 --> 00:02:55.138
-(ROARING)
-Over here!

00:02:55.218 --> 00:02:56.498
(YELPS, GRUNTS)

00:02:56.578 --> 00:02:57.698
(PANTING)

00:02:57.778 --> 00:02:59.898
That's right. Keep coming.

00:03:00.218 --> 00:03:01.658
Keep coming!

00:03:04.418 --> 00:03:05.618
(ROARS)

00:03:05.698 --> 00:03:06.818
(GASPS)

00:03:08.378 --> 00:03:09.378
That'll work.

00:03:09.898 --> 00:03:11.178
This way, guys!

00:03:14.378 --> 00:03:15.978
-(FOOTSTEPS THUDDING)
-(KRISTOFF GASPS)

00:03:21.978 --> 00:03:22.978
What?

00:03:24.098 --> 00:03:26.298
No, no, no, no.
She's leading them to the dam.

00:03:27.298 --> 00:03:29.178
(YELPING)

00:03:33.778 --> 00:03:35.218
(WHIMPERING)

00:03:36.738 --> 00:03:37.738
Kristoff!

00:03:37.898 --> 00:03:39.378
I'm here. What do you need?

00:03:39.538 --> 00:03:40.858
-To get to the dam.
-You got it.

00:03:40.938 --> 00:03:41.938
Thank you.

00:03:43.618 --> 00:03:44.938
(EARTH GIANT GROWLING)

00:03:45.018 --> 00:03:46.658
(ANNA GASPING)

00:03:58.138 --> 00:03:59.858
KRISTOFF: Come on. Come on.

00:04:00.018 --> 00:04:01.658
-ANNA: Help me up!
-We'll meet you around!

00:04:01.938 --> 00:04:03.138
(GRUNTING)

00:04:04.578 --> 00:04:05.698
(GASPS)

00:04:06.298 --> 00:04:07.378
Lieutenant Mattias.

00:04:07.578 --> 00:04:09.858
Your Highness,
what are you doing?

00:04:10.018 --> 00:04:11.338
The dam must fall.

00:04:11.498 --> 00:04:14.098
It's the only way to break
the mist and free the Forest.

00:04:14.258 --> 00:04:16.818
But we've sworn to protect
Arendelle at all costs.

00:04:16.978 --> 00:04:20.138
Arendelle has no future
until we make this right.

00:04:20.298 --> 00:04:22.218
King Runeard
betrayed everyone.

00:04:23.738 --> 00:04:25.018
How do you know that?

00:04:25.178 --> 00:04:27.538
My sister gave her life
for the truth.

00:04:30.218 --> 00:04:31.498
Please.

00:04:31.658 --> 00:04:33.458
Before we lose anyone else.

00:04:35.258 --> 00:04:36.458
(SIGHS)

00:04:39.298 --> 00:04:40.538
(INHALES DEEPLY)

00:04:48.778 --> 00:04:50.458
(EARTH GIANTS GROWLING)

00:04:55.818 --> 00:04:56.818
Look out!

00:04:57.018 --> 00:04:58.298
(BOTH GRUNT)

00:05:01.898 --> 00:05:03.098
(ANNA PANTING)

00:05:04.338 --> 00:05:06.298
Destroy the dam! Come on!

00:05:06.458 --> 00:05:07.858
Throw your boulders.

00:05:13.178 --> 00:05:14.258
That's it.

00:05:17.738 --> 00:05:18.978
(GASPS)

00:05:24.258 --> 00:05:25.658
(GRUNTING)

00:05:28.618 --> 00:05:29.578
(GRUNTS)

00:05:29.698 --> 00:05:30.738
(ANNA GASPS)

00:05:31.698 --> 00:05:33.298
-I've got her!
-Anna!

00:05:33.978 --> 00:05:35.218
MATTIAS: Hang on!

00:05:35.498 --> 00:05:36.698
(ALL GRUNT)

00:05:36.778 --> 00:05:37.778
(KRISTOFF EXHALES)

00:05:47.178 --> 00:05:48.218
(WIND WHOOSHING)

00:05:51.658 --> 00:05:53.258
-(ICE CRACKING)
-(GRUNTS)

00:05:58.058 --> 00:05:59.218
(CREATURE WHIMPERS)

00:06:18.618 --> 00:06:19.778
(CREATURE WHINNIES)

00:06:20.458 --> 00:06:21.698
(PANICKED CHATTERING)

